<title>UK: Zeneca down amid stock overhang.</title>
<headline>Zeneca down amid stock overhang.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Zeneca Group extended their losses on what traders characterised as a stock overhang.</p>
<p>By 1352 GMT, the shares were off 50p, or three percent, to 1387-1/2.  </p>
<p>&quot;There's a block of stock that's not being placed and is creating a technical overhang. That's all it is,&quot; said one analyst.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
